# OMEN AirPods gen 2 pairing (BlueZ + PipeWire) - GATED behind gate-12 bench POST receipt.
# The Mac Pro 3,1 can NEVER pair them (BT 2.0 + Lion, Apple compat matrix: 2nd gen needs
# macOS >= 10.14) - see docs/mac-daily-driver.md section 5. Console-safe, USER sd.

# --- read-only probe first (paste FULL output back) ---
bluetoothctl show
bluetoothctl devices
pactl list short sinks
pactl list short sources

# --- pairing (operator, interactive REPL): run bluetoothctl, then INSIDE it, one per line: ---
# agent on
# default-agent
# scan on            (put AirPods in pairing mode: case open, hold back button until white blink)
# pair <MAC-from-scan>
# trust <MAC>
# connect <MAC>
# quit

# --- post-pairing receipts (paste FULL output back; substitute the real MAC) ---
# bluetoothctl info AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF
pactl list short sinks
pactl list short sources

# Expect: A2DP sink (playback, AAC/SBC) + HFP source (mic, headset mode). Quality drop during
# calls = the HFP profile, not a fault; music returns to A2DP after the call.
# Route Discord/Vesktop mic via the EasyEffects virtual source, not the raw HFP source
# (docs/omen-daily-driver.md sections 2-3).

# --- ROLLBACK: bluetoothctl remove <MAC> ---
